We didn't. Sheldon did.

324
00:15:21,970 --> 00:15:23,470
你就让他答应了
And you just let him?

325
00:15:23,640 --> 00:15:25,300
上校还说这是苟利国家的事
Well, the colonel said it was for the good of the country,

326
00:15:25,470 --> 00:15:26,970
我们就因资金而趋之了
and the funding is substantial.

327
00:15:27,140 --> 00:15:28,720
没有  主要当时有一阵尴尬的沉默
No, but mostly, there was an awkward pause,

328
00:15:28,890 --> 00:15:31,480
于是为了打破尴尬局面  我就说了"好"
and I broke it by saying, "Okay."

329
00:15:33,310 --> 00:15:35,900
看来我要见不到你们一阵子了
So I guess I won't be seeing you guys for a while.

330
00:15:36,060 --> 00:15:37,440
是这样的
Oh, looks like it.

331
00:15:37,610 --> 00:15:41,110
你们去军方工作  独留我一人
Wow.You're going off to work with the military, leaving me behind.

332
00:15:41,280 --> 00:15:43,740
我突然理解军嫂的生活了
Now I know how all those army wives feel.

333
00:15:45,200 --> 00:15:48,370
你够了啊 我们就是在大学另一端而已
Would you stop?We're just gonna be on the other side of campus.

334
00:15:48,540 --> 00:15:50,160
也在这里
And right here.

335
00:15:52,500 --> 00:15:54,670
你就是一傻姑娘
You are a deeply silly man.

336
00:15:57,090 --> 00:15:59,050
他怎么如此不敢直面内心呢
He is so afraid of his feelings.

337
00:16:06,260 --> 00:16:08,350
-有空吗  -有啊  进来
-Got a minute?  -Yeah, come on in.

338
00:16:11,180 --> 00:16:12,640
我想道歉
I just wanted to apologize.

339
00:16:13,440 --> 00:16:15,020
我知道你是不小心说出去的
I know what you did was an accident.

340
00:16:15,440 --> 00:16:18,360
谢谢你  对不起  我跟你撒谎了
Oh, thank you, and I'm sorry I lied about it.

341
00:16:18,820 --> 00:16:20,360
不过  你撒谎挺在行的
Well,for what it's worth, you're a great liar.

342
00:16:20,690 --> 00:16:22,650
艾米也这么夸我的
Oh, that's what Amy said.

343
00:16:24,740 --> 00:16:26,030
研究项目怎么样了
So what's going on with the research project?

344
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:27,450
他们还会让你负责吗
Are they gonna let you run it?

345
00:16:27,620 --> 00:16:29,620
老板说他还没定下来
Well, my boss said he hadn't decided yet,

346
00:16:29,790 --> 00:16:32,500
于是我温柔地提醒了他 他是个有钱白人老头
so I gently reminded him that he's an old rich white guy,

347
00:16:32,660 --> 00:16:34,040
而我是个甜美无害的小孕妇
and I'm a sweet little pregnant lady

348
00:16:34,210 --> 00:16:36,420
在陪审团面前演落泪戏码  没在怕的
who's not afraid to cry in front of a jury.

349
00:16:38,460 --> 00:16:39,800
你威胁要告他
You threatened to sue?

350
00:16:40,210 --> 00:16:41,840
我多年前就已学会
Hey, I learned a long time ago,

351
00:16:42,010 --> 00:16:44,630
当你只有一米五 而平视只能看到每个男人裆部时
when you're four feet eleven and eye level with every guy's crotch,

352
00:16:44,880 --> 00:16:46,930
你就往那里捶就对了
that's where you punch.

353
00:16:48,470 --> 00:16:51,600
有点意思 我学到的不是捶  是...
That's funny.I learned something totally different.

354
00:16:54,100 --> 00:16:56,480
其实呢 不过是个研究项目
Do you know what?It's just a research project.

355
00:16:56,650 --> 00:16:59,730
世上最重要的工作 应该是抚养这个孩子
The most important job in the world is gonna be raising this child.

356
00:16:59,900 --> 00:17:01,690
那才赋予我生命的意义
It's all I need to give my life meaning.

357
00:17:01,900 --> 00:17:03,740
说得太好了
Oh, that's so beautiful.

358
00:17:04,070 --> 00:17:05,490
你信了  那就好
You believe me? Oh, good.

359
00:17:05,740 --> 00:17:08,740
再多11个像你这样的笨蛋 整个陪审团就随老娘摆布了
Eleven more chumps like you,I'll have the jury eating out of my hand.

360
00:17:11,910 --> 00:17:14,870
我之前都不知道这栋楼是机密建筑
I never realized this building was classified.

361
00:17:15,080 --> 00:17:17,750
也许正是因为它是机密
Maybe that's because it's classified.

362
00:17:20,540 --> 00:17:22,920
希望不会离我们的车位太远
Wish we weren't so far from my parking space.

363
00:17:23,170 --> 00:17:24,670
就你吃柠檬方块的那个熊样
The way you put away those lemon bars,

364
00:17:24,840 --> 00:17:26,420
远点是好事
perhaps that's a good thing.

365
00:17:27,930 --> 00:17:29,930
我希望恢复"你不许说话"规则
I'd like to reinstate the you-not-talking rule.

366
00:17:30,470 --> 00:17:32,390
为什么  明显没用
Why? It clearly doesn't work.

367
00:17:35,310 --> 00:17:36,770
应该就是这了
I guess this is it.

368
00:17:37,060 --> 00:17:38,440
那是视网膜扫描仪吗
Is that a retinal scanner?

369
00:17:38,940 --> 00:17:40,230
我们试试
Let's find out.

370
00:17:41,860 --> 00:17:43,690
霍华德·沃罗威茨  准许入内
Howard Wolowitz-- access granted.

371
00:17:44,440 --> 00:17:45,780
-不是吧  -太棒了
- No way! - Impressive!

372
00:17:45,940 --> 00:17:47,240
该我了  该我了
Oh, my turn! My turn!

373
00:17:48,280 --> 00:17:50,450
莱纳德·霍夫斯塔特  准许入内
Leonard Hofstadter-- access granted.

374
00:17:50,620 --> 00:17:52,950
我都不需要把眼睛摘下来呢
I didn't even have to take my glasses off!

375
00:17:57,750 --> 00:17:59,170
拒绝入内
Access denied.

376
00:17:59,330 --> 00:18:00,630
-它知道呢  -它知道呢
-It knows!  -It knows!

377
00:18:06,880 --> 00:18:09,970
你们  大头朝下抱着我
Oh, oh, oh, oh, guys, hold me upside down!

378
00:18:17,310 --> 00:18:19,440
霍华德·沃罗威茨  准许入内
Howard Wolowitz, access granted.

